@startuml durable-write-sequence
' ============================================================================
' Order-A durable write — "log before publish".
' Source of truth: src/persistent_artrie/core/overlay/durable_write.rs (the
' DurableOverlayWrite Template-Method skeleton) + lockfree_cas.rs.
' Color key:  green = lock-free in-memory visibility (the overlay)
'             blue  = durable on-disk WAL (append + fsync)
'             amber = the committed durability frontier (watermark + commit-rank)
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #37474F
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam noteBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam participantBorderColor #37474F

title Order-A durable write — "log before publish" (acknowledged ⟹ durable AND visible)

participant "Client" as C
participant "Lock-free overlay\n(atomic root)" as O #C8E6C9
participant "WAL\nappend + fsync" as W #BBDEFB
participant "Committed watermark\n+ commit-rank" as M #FFE0B2

C -> O : insert(key, value)
activate O
note right of O #C8E6C9 : **Step 0 — present-hoist**\n**NON-FAULTING** membership read on the\nhot path (never holds the buffer-manager\nlock → avoids the lock-ordering deadlock)
O -> O : build copy-on-write node path

== Step 1 — durability gate:  append the WAL record DURABLE, *before* any visibility ==
O -> W : append_durable(WalRecord)\nImmediate fsync  |  GroupCommit batch
activate W
W --> O : Lsn(data)  —  record is now **durable**
deactivate W
note over O, W : Order B (CAS-then-log) is **rejected** — it could expose a\nvisible-but-not-durable write. The single append covers every\nCAS retry (re-appending would burn LSNs + hole the watermark).

== Step 2 — publish:  the visibility point = the linearization point ==
loop until the root CAS wins
  O -> O : root CAS publish (winner linearizes here)
end

== Step 3 — commit-rank, then advance the committed watermark ==
O -> W : append CommitRank (durable)
activate W
W --> O : Lsn(rank)
deactivate W
O -> M : mark_committed(data_lsn)\nmark_committed(rank_lsn)
activate M
note right of M #FFE0B2 : the committed contiguous prefix advances to\ncover BOTH LSNs — the ONLY safe checkpoint_lsn\nunder out-of-order lock-free commit (TLC-verified)
M --> O : watermark advanced
deactivate M

O --> C : Ack  —  the write is now **durable AND visible**
deactivate O

note across #FFF9C4 : **Crash semantics.** A write is acknowledged *iff* its record is in the WAL:\nfsync'd ⇒ replayed on recovery · not fsync'd ⇒ was never acknowledged.
@enduml
